# Telco Customer Churn Analysis

## Overview

This project analyzes customer churn in a telecommunications
customer dataset using Power BI.

The objective is to understand customer characteristics,
churn patterns, customer value, and high-risk customer segments.

## Dashboard Pages

1. Overview
2. Customer Profile
3. Churn Analysis
4. Customer Value
5. Risk × Value
6. Findings & Recommendations

## Key Analysis

- Customer churn rate
- Churn by contract
- Churn by tenure
- Churn by customer profile
- Customer value using CLTV
- Churn risk segmentation
- Risk × Value analysis

## Tools

- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Excel
- GitHub

## Project Status

Initial dashboard completed.
Further deep analysis and recommendations will be developed next.
